{
    "title": "Talabatey \u0637\u0644\u0628\u0627\u062a\u064a",
    "description": "Hungry? \r\nAll the delicious food can be speedily and efficiently delivered to your door steps by \u201cTalabatey According to your Orders\u201d. \r\nAll you need to do is to download the application \u201cTalabatey\u201d or \u201cItlib wa Tadalal\u201d. We have chosen this slogan because our objective is to make your life easier since we care for all your daily diet demands.\r\n\u201cTalabatey\u201d can meet all your food desires promptly and easily whether you prefer popular, eastern or western dishes, fast food, sweets, or drinks. \r\nBy using Talabatey application, you will be able to order any type of food you like from more than 1000 restaurants in Iraq and Sudan and in Syria.\r\nThe Application advantages:\r\nSimple, easy to use and speedy; all that you need to do is to determine your location and then to choose your favorite dish; that is all.\r\nExtensive choices of restaurants: more than 1000 restaurant in Iraq and Sudan and in Syria\r\nYou have the option to select the meal that you like.\r\nYou can also get discounts and special offers from the restaurants on Talabatey application\r\nIt clarifies to you the meal cost together with the delivery cost if required\r\nIt will also tell you when the restaurants are open or closed.\r\nOn the application, there are lists of the meals that are in demand to help you choose if you prefer any of them\r\nThe countries available are Iraq, Sudan and Syria and Kenya soon",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hungry? <br>All the delicious food can be speedily and efficiently delivered to your door steps by \u201cTalabatey According to your Orders\u201d. <br>All you need to do is to download the application \u201cTalabatey\u201d or \u201cItlib wa Tadalal\u201d. We have chosen this slogan because our objective is to make your life easier since we care for all your daily diet demands.<br>\u201cTalabatey\u201d can meet all your food desires promptly and easily whether you prefer popular, eastern or western dishes, fast food, sweets, or drinks. <br>By using Talabatey application, you will be able to order any type of food you like from more than 1000 restaurants in Iraq and Sudan and in Syria.<br>The Application advantages:<br>Simple, easy to use and speedy; all that you need to do is to determine your location and then to choose your favorite dish; that is all.<br>Extensive choices of restaurants: more than 1000 restaurant in Iraq and Sudan and in Syria<br>You have the option to select the meal that you like.<br>You can also get discounts and special offers from the restaurants on Talabatey application<br>It clarifies to you the meal cost together with the delivery cost if required<br>It will also tell you when the restaurants are open or closed.<br>On the application, there are lists of the meals that are in demand to help you choose if you prefer any of them<br>The countries available are Iraq, Sudan and Syria and Kenya soon",
